    "stdout": "T020 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (E : Set (YEucl n)),\n  E.Nonempty →\n    (∀ (m : ℕ) (A : Set (YEucl m)), YCritical A) →\n      (∀ (m : ℕ) (x y : YEucl m) (t u : ℝ), dist (YJoin x t) (YJoin y u) = √(dist x y ^ 2 + |t - u| ^ 2)) ∧\n          (∀ (m : ℕ) (z : YEucl (m + 1)), YJoin (YBase z) (YLast z) = z) ∧\n            (∀ (m : ℕ) (x : YEucl m) (t : ℝ), YBase (YJoin x t) = x ∧ YLast (YJoin x t) = t) ∧\n              (∀ (m : ℕ), LipschitzWith 1 YBase ∧ LipschitzWith 1 YLast) ∧ Isometry YLine ∧ Function.Surjective YLine →\n        (dimH YI = 1 ∧\n            (∀ (a : ℝ), 1 < a → YHaus a YI = 0) ∧\n              (∀ (s δ : ℝ),\n                  0 < s →\n                    s < 1 →\n                      0 < δ →\n                        ∀ (U : ℕ → Set ℝ),\n                          YCover δ YI U → 1 ≤ ∑' (i : ℕ), Metric.ediam (U i) ∧ ENNReal.ofReal δ ^ (s - 1) ≤ YCost s U) ∧\n                ∀ (s : ℝ), 0 < s → s < 1 → YHaus s YI = ∞) →\n          dimH E = 0 → 1 ≤ dimH (YF E) ∧ 1 = dimH E + 1\n'Translation.T020' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
